                <li>
        <a class="ind-table-of-content__link" href="#eu-turkey-association-agreement">EU-Turkey Association Agreement</a>
      </li>
                <li>
        <a class="ind-table-of-content__link" href="#less-strict-requirements-by-association-agreement">Less strict requirements by Association Agreement</a>
      </li>
                <li>
        <a class="ind-table-of-content__link" href="#applying-for-a-residence-permit-according-to-association-agreement">Applying for a residence permit according to Association Agreement</a>
