<div class="ind-flow ind-section ind-section--inset:start-collapse" data-component-id="ind2:section">
      
                                                          
          



<div data-component-id="ind2:meta" class="ind-meta">
      <div class="ind-meta__item">
                      <span class="ind-meta__label">Last update: </span>
      
                  <time datetime="2026-07-31T12:00:00Z">31 July 2026</time>

          

          </div>
  </div>

              
      


  <p class="ind-paragraph--lead">You are a Turkish citizen, or family member of a Turkish citizen, and want to apply for a residence permit in the Netherlands. Because of the Association Agreement between the European Union and Turkey, the requirements are sometimes less strict for Turkish citizens and their families. Find out if these requirements apply to you.</p>


      
      
          
      </div>

  

                        
  






<section class="ind-flow ind-section ind-section--inset:start-collapse" data-component-id="ind2:section">
      
                              




<h2 id="eu-turkey-association-agreement" data-component-id="ind2:heading" class="ind-heading ind-heading--h2">
      EU-Turkey Association Agreement
  </h2>

  
  

  
  

  <p>The Association Agreement between the European Union (EU) and Turkey was laid down in 1963. Additions to the Association Agreement were made with the Additional Protocol in 1970 and Decision 1/80 in 1980. The Association Agreement applies to Turkish citizens and self-employed persons and their families, and to Turkish service providers.</p>

<div class="ind:clear-both"></div>


  






  


<div data-component-id="ind2:accordion" class="ind-accordion">
      


<a class="ind-accordion__toggler ind-link" aria-expanded="false" data-accordion-expand-label="Expand all" data-accordion-collapse-label="Collapse all" role="button" data-component-id="ind2:link" href="#">
          <span class="ind-accordion__toggler-label">Expand all</span>

        



<span class="ind-accordion__toggler-icon ind-accordion__toggler-icon--expand ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-plus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M12 5l0 14"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

        



<span class="ind-accordion__toggler-icon ind-accordion__toggler-icon--collapse ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-minus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

      </a>
  
                  




<div data-component-id="ind2:expandable" class="ind-expandable">
  <h3 class="ind-expandable__heading">
    <button
      class="ind-expandable__button"
      type="button"
      data-collapse-handler="#accordion-35218"
      aria-expanded="false"
    >
      Turkish employees

              



<span class="ind-expandable__icon ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-plus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M12 5l0 14"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

              



<span class="ind-expandable__icon ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-minus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

          </button>
  </h3>

  


<div class="ind-expandable__collapse ind-collapse" data-component-id="ind2:collapse" id="accordion-35218">
  <div class="ind-collapse__inner">
          
  

  <p>For Turkish employees, the following requirements apply:</p><ul><li>You have the Turkish nationality. In addition, you may have another nationality, for example the Dutch nationality.</li><li>You are legally employed in the Netherlands.</li><li>You carry out genuine and effective work. This is certainly the case in 1 of these situations:<ul><li>Your salary is at least 50% of the social welfare level. On the Dutch Government’s website, you can find the amount of <a href="https://www.rijksoverheid.nl/documenten/vraag-en-antwoord/bijstand/hoe-hoog-is-mijn-bijstandsuitkering" title="Rijksoverheid.nl: Hoe wordt de hoogte van mijn bijstandsuitkering berekend?">Social welfare benefits in the Netherlands</a> (this link is only available in Dutch).</li><li>You work at least 40% of the common full working week.</li></ul></li><li>You do not pose any risk to public order and national security.</li></ul>

<div class="ind:clear-both"></div>



      </div>
</div>

</div>

                




<div data-component-id="ind2:expandable" class="ind-expandable">
  <h3 class="ind-expandable__heading">
    <button
      class="ind-expandable__button"
      type="button"
      data-collapse-handler="#accordion-35220"
      aria-expanded="false"
    >
      Turkish self-employed persons

              



<span class="ind-expandable__icon ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-plus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M12 5l0 14"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

              



<span class="ind-expandable__icon ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-minus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

          </button>
  </h3>

  


<div class="ind-expandable__collapse ind-collapse" data-component-id="ind2:collapse" id="accordion-35220">
  <div class="ind-collapse__inner">
          
  

  <p>For Turkish self-employed persons, the following requirements apply:</p><ul><li>You work as a self-employed person in the Netherlands.&nbsp;</li><li>You have a valid Dutch residence permit that allows you to work as a self-employed person.</li><li>You perform real and actual work. This is certainly the case in 1 of these situations:<ul><li>Your salary is at least 50% of the social welfare level. On the Dutch Government’s website, you can find the amount of <a href="https://www.rijksoverheid.nl/documenten/vraag-en-antwoord/bijstand/hoe-hoog-is-mijn-bijstandsuitkering" title="Rijksoverheid.nl: Hoe wordt de hoogte van mijn bijstandsuitkering berekend?">Social welfare benefits in the Netherlands</a> (this link is only available in Dutch).</li><li>You work at least 40% of the common full working week.</li></ul></li><li>You are not a danger to public order or national security.&nbsp;</li></ul><p>or:</p><ul><li>You want to work as a self-employed person in the Netherlands.</li><li>You apply for a residence permit for work as a self-employed person, start-up or looking for and performing work (orientation year).</li><li>You are not a danger to public order or national security.&nbsp;</li></ul>

<div class="ind:clear-both"></div>



      </div>
</div>

</div>

                




<div data-component-id="ind2:expandable" class="ind-expandable">
  <h3 class="ind-expandable__heading">
    <button
      class="ind-expandable__button"
      type="button"
      data-collapse-handler="#accordion-35222"
      aria-expanded="false"
    >
      Turkish service providers

              



<span class="ind-expandable__icon ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-plus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M12 5l0 14"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

              



<span class="ind-expandable__icon ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-minus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

          </button>
  </h3>

  


<div class="ind-expandable__collapse ind-collapse" data-component-id="ind2:collapse" id="accordion-35222">
  <div class="ind-collapse__inner">
          
  

  <p>For Turkish service providers, the following requirements apply:</p><ul><li>You live in Turkey and you are the owner of a company established in Turkey. Or you work for a company established in in Turkey.</li><li>You (temporarily) provide a service. For example, an industrial or commercial service.</li><li>You are compensated for your service.</li></ul>

<div class="ind:clear-both"></div>



      </div>
</div>

</div>

                




<div data-component-id="ind2:expandable" class="ind-expandable">
  <h3 class="ind-expandable__heading">
    <button
      class="ind-expandable__button"
      type="button"
      data-collapse-handler="#accordion-35224"
      aria-expanded="false"
    >
      Family members of Turkish employees and self-employed persons

              



<span class="ind-expandable__icon ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-plus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M12 5l0 14"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

              



<span class="ind-expandable__icon ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-minus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

          </button>
  </h3>

  


<div class="ind-expandable__collapse ind-collapse" data-component-id="ind2:collapse" id="accordion-35224">
  <div class="ind-collapse__inner">
          
  

  <p>You are one of the following family members:</p><ul><li>You are the spouse or registered partner.</li><li>You are the child of a Turkish employee or of the spouse or registered partner of a Turkish employee. You are under 21 years old. Older children must depend on the Turkish employee for their basic necessities. Basic necessities are for example food, clothes and housing. These rules also apply to grandchildren who are members of the employee’s family.</li><li>You are the parent or grandparent of a Turkish employee or of the spouse or registered partner of a Turkish employee. Parents and grandparents must depend on the Turkish employee for their basic necessities.</li></ul>

<div class="ind:clear-both"></div>



      </div>
</div>

</div>

      </div>




          
      </section>


  






<section class="ind-flow ind-section" data-component-id="ind2:section">
      
                              




<h2 id="less-strict-requirements-by-association-agreement" data-component-id="ind2:heading" class="ind-heading ind-heading--h2">
      Less strict requirements by Association Agreement
  </h2>

  
  

  
  

  <p>Because of the Association Agreement between the EU and Turkey, these less strict requirements apply to Turkish citizens and their families.</p>

<div class="ind:clear-both"></div>


  






  


<div data-component-id="ind2:accordion" class="ind-accordion">
      


<a class="ind-accordion__toggler ind-link" aria-expanded="false" data-accordion-expand-label="Expand all" data-accordion-collapse-label="Collapse all" role="button" data-component-id="ind2:link" href="#">
          <span class="ind-accordion__toggler-label">Expand all</span>

        



<span class="ind-accordion__toggler-icon ind-accordion__toggler-icon--expand ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-plus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M12 5l0 14"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

        



<span class="ind-accordion__toggler-icon ind-accordion__toggler-icon--collapse ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-minus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

      </a>
  
                  




<div data-component-id="ind2:expandable" class="ind-expandable">
  <h3 class="ind-expandable__heading">
    <button
      class="ind-expandable__button"
      type="button"
      data-collapse-handler="#accordion-35229"
      aria-expanded="false"
    >
      Lower costs (fees) when applying for residence permit  

              



<span class="ind-expandable__icon ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-plus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M12 5l0 14"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

              



<span class="ind-expandable__icon ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-minus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

          </button>
  </h3>

  


<div class="ind-expandable__collapse ind-collapse" data-component-id="ind2:collapse" id="accordion-35229">
  <div class="ind-collapse__inner">
          
  

  <p>Turkish citizens and their family members often pay lower costs when applying for a residence permit in the Netherlands. The costs are also lower when applying for extension, a return visa, or replacement of a residence document. Read more information about the costs of an application on our webpage <a href="/en/fees-costs-of-an-application" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="dd3911c6-a598-4819-95eb-96fbd0d2507b" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Fees: costs of an application">Fees: costs of an application</a>.</p>

<div class="ind:clear-both"></div>



      </div>
</div>

</div>

                




<div data-component-id="ind2:expandable" class="ind-expandable">
  <h3 class="ind-expandable__heading">
    <button
      class="ind-expandable__button"
      type="button"
      data-collapse-handler="#accordion-35231"
      aria-expanded="false"
    >
      Lower age requirement when applying for residence permit for partner

              



<span class="ind-expandable__icon ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-plus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M12 5l0 14"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

              



<span class="ind-expandable__icon ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-minus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

          </button>
  </h3>

  


<div class="ind-expandable__collapse ind-collapse" data-component-id="ind2:collapse" id="accordion-35231">
  <div class="ind-collapse__inner">
          
  

  <p>Are you a Turkish citizen working in the Netherlands and you want to bring your spouse or registered partner to the Netherlands to live with you? In this case, you and your partner must both be at least 18 instead of 21.</p>

<div class="ind:clear-both"></div>



      </div>
</div>

</div>

                




<div data-component-id="ind2:expandable" class="ind-expandable">
  <h3 class="ind-expandable__heading">
    <button
      class="ind-expandable__button"
      type="button"
      data-collapse-handler="#accordion-35233"
      aria-expanded="false"
    >
      Obligatory recognised sponsor not required

              



<span class="ind-expandable__icon ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-plus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M12 5l0 14"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

              



<span class="ind-expandable__icon ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-minus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

          </button>
  </h3>

  


<div class="ind-expandable__collapse ind-collapse" data-component-id="ind2:collapse" id="accordion-35233">
  <div class="ind-collapse__inner">
          
  

  <p>Have you found work as a highly skilled migrant? Or work as a researcher under Directive (EU) 2016/801? Normally, only <a href="/en/residence-permits/work/apply-for-recognition-as-sponsor" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="7938b4da-7d75-4710-9498-523efdc1e999" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Apply for recognition as sponsor">recognised sponsors</a> can apply for these residence permits. For employees with Turkish nationality, a recognised sponsor is not required. You can also submit the application yourself.&nbsp;</p><p>Also for other work in paid employment, a sponsor is not required. However, you need to have found a job before you can apply for the residence permit.&nbsp;</p><h4>IND decides faster on the application of a recognised sponsor</h4><p>Still, the IND advises you to have a recognised sponsor apply for you. This is because the IND decides faster if a recognised sponsor applies. Do you want to apply yourself? Then use 1 of the following forms:</p><h5>MVV needed</h5><p>Do you need a <a href="/en/provisional-residence-permit-mvv" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="92441f75-463f-4e02-89cc-51a010a86f2a" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Provisional residence permit (MVV)">provisional residence permit (MVV)</a> and do you want to work as a researcher or highly skilled migrant?&nbsp;  



      </p><figure>
  
  
  
  


<a rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" data-component-id="ind2:link" class="ind-link" href="/nl/formulieren/9532.pdf">
        



<span data-component-id="ind2:icon" class="ind-icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-file-description ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true">
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none" /><path d="M14 3v4a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h4" /><path d="M17 21h-10a2 2 0 0 1 -2 -2v-14a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2h7l5 5v11a2 2 0 0 1 -2 2z" /><path d="M9 17h6" /><path d="M9 13h6" />
</svg>
</span>

      Application for admission and residence for working purposes (foreign national) (PDF, 546.36 KB)
    </a>

      </figure>
  

<h5>No MVV needed</h5><p>Do you not need a MVV?&nbsp;  



      </p><figure>
  
  
  
  


<a rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" data-component-id="ind2:link" class="ind-link" href="/en/forms/7531.pdf">
        



<span data-component-id="ind2:icon" class="ind-icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-file-description ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true">
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none" /><path d="M14 3v4a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h4" /><path d="M17 21h-10a2 2 0 0 1 -2 -2v-14a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2h7l5 5v11a2 2 0 0 1 -2 2z" /><path d="M9 17h6" /><path d="M9 13h6" />
</svg>
</span>

      Application for a residence permit in connection with the Convention between the European Union and Turkey (PDF, 1.58 MB)
    </a>

      </figure>
  

<p>Find out the <a href="/en/after-your-application/decision-periods" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="0c4e33c7-49fa-4198-b4ec-915e4c1cb668" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Decision periods">decision period for your residence permit application</a>.</p>

<div class="ind:clear-both"></div>



      </div>
</div>

</div>

                




<div data-component-id="ind2:expandable" class="ind-expandable">
  <h3 class="ind-expandable__heading">
    <button
      class="ind-expandable__button"
      type="button"
      data-collapse-handler="#accordion-35235"
      aria-expanded="false"
    >
      No point system for residence permit for work on self-employed basis

              



<span class="ind-expandable__icon ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-plus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M12 5l0 14"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

              



<span class="ind-expandable__icon ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-minus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

          </button>
  </h3>

  


<div class="ind-expandable__collapse ind-collapse" data-component-id="ind2:collapse" id="accordion-35235">
  <div class="ind-collapse__inner">
          
  

  <p>Are you applying for a residence permit as a self-employed person? Then the Netherlands Enterprise Agency (in Dutch:<em> Rijksdienst voor Ondernemend Nederland</em> or RVO) assesses whether your company is of essential interest to the Netherlands. Essential interest means that the company must add value to the Netherlands. The RVO assesses this according to a points system. A company must get a minimum number of points. This points system does not apply to Turkish nationals. The RVO only assesses your company by looking at your business plan.</p><p>These are the aspects RVO looks at in the business plan:</p><ul><li>Your company is financially healthy.</li><li>Your company provides something that is needed in the Netherlands.</li><li>Your company helps the Dutch economy to grow.</li><li>Your company can do well in the free-market economy.</li><li>Your company does not disrupt the free-market economy or labour market.</li></ul><p>The business plan must have a financial explanation for every part.</p>

<div class="ind:clear-both"></div>



      </div>
</div>

</div>

                




<div data-component-id="ind2:expandable" class="ind-expandable">
  <h3 class="ind-expandable__heading">
    <button
      class="ind-expandable__button"
      type="button"
      data-collapse-handler="#accordion-35237"
      aria-expanded="false"
    >
      No more work permit (TWV) needed after working 3 years

              



<span class="ind-expandable__icon ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-plus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M12 5l0 14"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

              



<span class="ind-expandable__icon ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-minus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

          </button>
  </h3>

  


<div class="ind-expandable__collapse ind-collapse" data-component-id="ind2:collapse" id="accordion-35237">
  <div class="ind-collapse__inner">
          
  

  <p>Are you a Turkish citizen and do you work in paid employment in the Netherlands? Then you no longer need a work permit (in Dutch: <em>tewerkstellingsvergunning</em> or TWV) for paid employment after 3 years with the same employer. Normally, this is only after 5 years.</p>

<div class="ind:clear-both"></div>



      </div>
</div>

</div>

                




<div data-component-id="ind2:expandable" class="ind-expandable">
  <h3 class="ind-expandable__heading">
    <button
      class="ind-expandable__button"
      type="button"
      data-collapse-handler="#accordion-35239"
      aria-expanded="false"
    >
      No civic integration diploma needed when applying for a residence permit humanitarian non-temporary

              



<span class="ind-expandable__icon ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-plus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M12 5l0 14"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

              



<span class="ind-expandable__icon ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-minus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

          </button>
  </h3>

  


<div class="ind-expandable__collapse ind-collapse" data-component-id="ind2:collapse" id="accordion-35239">
  <div class="ind-collapse__inner">
          
  

  <p>Are you a Turkish citizen? And do you apply for a <a href="/en/replace-extend-renew-and-change/change/residence-permit-humanitarian-non-temporary" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="db0bbdf9-b1f2-4469-9206-40f16350ab39" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Residence permit humanitarian non-temporary">residence permit humanitarian non-temporary</a> after residence with a family member? Then you do not need a civic integration diploma in the following situations:</p><ul><li>You are working legally in the Netherlands.</li><li>You are planning to work legally in the Netherlands.</li><li>You are a family member of one of these groups.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</li></ul>

<div class="ind:clear-both"></div>



      </div>
</div>

</div>

      </div>




          
      </section>


  






<section class="ind-flow ind-section" data-component-id="ind2:section">
      
                              




<h2 id="applying-for-a-residence-permit-according-to-association-agreement" data-component-id="ind2:heading" class="ind-heading ind-heading--h2">
      Applying for a residence permit according to Association Agreement
  </h2>

  
  

  
  

  <p>Turkish citizens and their family members can apply for the following residence permits according to Association Agreement between the EU and Turkey.&nbsp;</p>

<div class="ind:clear-both"></div>


  






  


<div data-component-id="ind2:accordion" class="ind-accordion">
      


<a class="ind-accordion__toggler ind-link" aria-expanded="false" data-accordion-expand-label="Expand all" data-accordion-collapse-label="Collapse all" role="button" data-component-id="ind2:link" href="#">
          <span class="ind-accordion__toggler-label">Expand all</span>

        



<span class="ind-accordion__toggler-icon ind-accordion__toggler-icon--expand ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-plus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M12 5l0 14"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

        



<span class="ind-accordion__toggler-icon ind-accordion__toggler-icon--collapse ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-minus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

      </a>
  
                  




<div data-component-id="ind2:expandable" class="ind-expandable">
  <h3 class="ind-expandable__heading">
    <button
      class="ind-expandable__button"
      type="button"
      data-collapse-handler="#accordion-35244"
      aria-expanded="false"
    >
      Residence permit for paid employment 

              



<span class="ind-expandable__icon ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-plus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M12 5l0 14"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

              



<span class="ind-expandable__icon ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-minus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

          </button>
  </h3>

  


<div class="ind-expandable__collapse ind-collapse" data-component-id="ind2:collapse" id="accordion-35244">
  <div class="ind-collapse__inner">
          
  

  <h4>Requirements</h4><p>These are the requirements for this residence permit:</p><ul><li>You meet the <a href="/en/requirements-that-apply-to-everyone" title="Requirements that apply to everyone" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="865d3eec-bd83-42a0-b3bb-bf101809c4ca" data-entity-substitution="canonical">general requirements</a> that apply to everyone.</li><li>You have been working for the same Dutch employer for at least 1 year.</li><li>You have a valid residence permit to work for this employer. And this residence permit is valid for the full period you work for this employer.</li><li>You are still working for the same employer.</li></ul><h4>Application form</h4><p>Use the form:   



      </p><figure>
  
  
  
  


<a rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" data-component-id="ind2:link" class="ind-link" href="/en/forms/7531.pdf">
        



<span data-component-id="ind2:icon" class="ind-icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-file-description ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true">
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none" /><path d="M14 3v4a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h4" /><path d="M17 21h-10a2 2 0 0 1 -2 -2v-14a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2h7l5 5v11a2 2 0 0 1 -2 2z" /><path d="M9 17h6" /><path d="M9 13h6" />
</svg>
</span>

      Application for a residence permit in connection with the Convention between the European Union and Turkey (PDF, 1.58 MB)
    </a>

      </figure>
  

<h4>Working with the residence permit</h4><p>If you get this residence permit your employer does not need a work permit (TWV) for you. Are you going to work for another employer? And you did not yet work for the same employer in the Netherlands for 3 years in total? Then your new employer does need a TWV.</p>

<div class="ind:clear-both"></div>



      </div>
</div>

</div>

                




<div data-component-id="ind2:expandable" class="ind-expandable">
  <h3 class="ind-expandable__heading">
    <button
      class="ind-expandable__button"
      type="button"
      data-collapse-handler="#accordion-35246"
      aria-expanded="false"
    >
      Independent residence permit after stay with family member

              



<span class="ind-expandable__icon ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-plus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M12 5l0 14"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

              



<span class="ind-expandable__icon ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-minus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

          </button>
  </h3>

  


<div class="ind-expandable__collapse ind-collapse" data-component-id="ind2:collapse" id="accordion-35246">
  <div class="ind-collapse__inner">
          
  

  <h4>Requirements</h4><p>These are the requirements for this residence permit:</p><ul><li>You meet the <a href="/en/requirements-that-apply-to-everyone" title="Requirements that apply to everyone" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="865d3eec-bd83-42a0-b3bb-bf101809c4ca" data-entity-substitution="canonical">general requirements</a> that apply to everyone.</li><li>You have lived in the Netherlands with a Turkish employee for at least 3 years with a residence permit for stay as a family member. The Turkish employee has a <a href="/en/temporary-and-non-temporary-purposes-of-residence" title="Temporary and non-temporary purposes of residence" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="8a975afb-089b-41c2-9a95-a40b58856cee" data-entity-substitution="canonical">residence permit for a non-temporary purpose</a>, <span>or has both Turkish and Dutch nationality</span>.</li><li>You meet the requirements to extend your residence permit to stay with a family member.</li></ul><h4>Application form</h4><p>Use the form:   



      </p><figure>
  
  
  
  


<a rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" data-component-id="ind2:link" class="ind-link" href="/en/forms/7531.pdf">
        



<span data-component-id="ind2:icon" class="ind-icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-file-description ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true">
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none" /><path d="M14 3v4a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h4" /><path d="M17 21h-10a2 2 0 0 1 -2 -2v-14a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2h7l5 5v11a2 2 0 0 1 -2 2z" /><path d="M9 17h6" /><path d="M9 13h6" />
</svg>
</span>

      Application for a residence permit in connection with the Convention between the European Union and Turkey (PDF, 1.58 MB)
    </a>

      </figure>
  



<div class="ind:clear-both"></div>



      </div>
</div>

</div>

                




<div data-component-id="ind2:expandable" class="ind-expandable">
  <h3 class="ind-expandable__heading">
    <button
      class="ind-expandable__button"
      type="button"
      data-collapse-handler="#accordion-35248"
      aria-expanded="false"
    >
      Residence permit for finding and carrying out work (orientation year) after marriage has ended

              



<span class="ind-expandable__icon ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-plus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M12 5l0 14"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

              



<span class="ind-expandable__icon ind-icon" data-component-id="ind2:icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
   width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-minus ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true"
>
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M5 12l14 0"/>
</svg>
</span>

          </button>
  </h3>

  


<div class="ind-expandable__collapse ind-collapse" data-component-id="ind2:collapse" id="accordion-35248">
  <div class="ind-collapse__inner">
          
  

  <p>You can look for and carry out work in paid employment or start working on a self-employed basis with this permit.&nbsp;</p><h4>Requirements</h4><p>These are the requirements for this residence permit.</p><ul><li>You meet the <a href="/en/requirements-that-apply-to-everyone" title="Requirements that apply to everyone" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="865d3eec-bd83-42a0-b3bb-bf101809c4ca" data-entity-substitution="canonical">general requirements</a> that apply to everyone.</li><li>You have had at least 3 years of marriage, or a registered partnership, with a Turkish employee who has a <a href="/en/temporary-and-non-temporary-purposes-of-residence" title="Temporary and non-temporary purposes of residence" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="8a975afb-089b-41c2-9a95-a40b58856cee" data-entity-substitution="canonical">residence permit with a non-temporary purpose</a>.</li><li>The marriage or registered partnership has ended.</li><li>You lived in the Netherlands at least 1 year, right before your marriage or registered partnership ended. During this year, you had a residence permit to stay with your spouse or registered partner.</li><li>You must submit your application after your marriage or registered partnership has ended. Or when you no longer live together.</li></ul><h4>Application form</h4><p>Use the form:   



      </p><figure>
  
  
  
  


<a rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" data-component-id="ind2:link" class="ind-link" href="/en/forms/7531.pdf">
        



<span data-component-id="ind2:icon" class="ind-icon" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-file-description ind-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true">
  <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none" /><path d="M14 3v4a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h4" /><path d="M17 21h-10a2 2 0 0 1 -2 -2v-14a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2h7l5 5v11a2 2 0 0 1 -2 2z" /><path d="M9 17h6" /><path d="M9 13h6" />
</svg>
</span>

      Application for a residence permit in connection with the Convention between the European Union and Turkey (PDF, 1.58 MB)
    </a>

      </figure>
  



